&07A mass of gigantic swirling tentacles explodes from the depths!&00
~
   Unfortunately for you, you have stumbled upon the dreaded Kraken. Perhaps
200 feet long, this gigantic squidlike creature is rumored to have destroyed
many a sea-faring vessel. With 8 long tentacles and 2 huge arms which
could encircle a large ship, the Kraken is one of nature's most deadly
predators. You stare into its large glassy eyes and resign yourself to death
as it grips you in its tentacle and moves you towards its large horned
beak, which looks to be perfect for shredding flesh.
~
