a Sea-Dragon~
&07A colorful winged serpent hisses at you loudly.&00
~
   Colored from head to tail in iridescent scales, the Sea-Dragon is a
beautiful, albeit deadly creature. A lesser dragon, the Sea-Dragon lacks
fore and hind claws, relying on its massive wings and powerful jaws to
capture and destroy its prey. They are known to be generally docile and
to keep to themselves, but this one is obviously quite hungry.
~
